{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act21side_level_act21side_10_beg",
  "groupId": "act21side",
  "stageId": "act21side_10",
  "title": "“狼之主”",
  "storyCode": "IS-10",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act21side/level_act21side_10_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "db4902809d617b5ad3202ce7d56a115a400568c033e492cc5a4e000f47fe6c88",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmencommand"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "偵察完畢，沒有敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們提供的路線圖還真厲害啊，我們居然一路上沒怎麼遇到阻礙，就最先抵達了這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "新城區的設計，使用的都是來自哥倫比亞的技術。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其中有許多家族成員們完全不曾瞭解的功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比如說，在我們通過之後，直接通往這座指揮塔的道路如今被封鎖了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他的一些路口也或多或少被他們用一些技術手段封鎖了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "加上，我們在路上也看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "家族之間的鬥爭已經逐漸蔓延開了，恐怕，大部分家族即使想要對指揮塔動手，也會被其他家族絆住吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，他們根本想不到，指揮塔已經被我們佔領了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。但是，還不到放心的時候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論是貝洛內，羅塞蒂，還是薩盧佐，至少這三個家族，絕不會放棄這個次級核心區，他們一定會來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有我和德克薩斯在，安心啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，我本意並不想把你們也捲進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是自願的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也是自願的！作為報酬，你可以之後告訴我，哪裡的披薩比較好吃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛才說，這些技術來自哥倫比亞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，羅塞蒂家族提供了不少支持，所以，我確實也有些擔心他們會有突破的方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......告訴我，如果他們有必經之路，會是哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g1_srcstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對勁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也感覺到了嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然其他家族的阻礙也是一部分原因......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，如果說剛才那道大門，可能是因為某些意外而被啟動了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼我們繞路繞到現在，我基本可以確定，這些封鎖，絕對是故意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是說，有人先我們一步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，他們很瞭解這個區域的構造。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而瞭解這些的，應該是我們羅塞蒂的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，參與了這個次級核心區改造的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......先不論究竟是誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道該如何突破？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我可以試試，我手下應該有人知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太浪費時間了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果這真的是有人刻意而為之，那一定會為此上保險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你想說什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我們的合作也談不上愉快，不過，看起來也就到此為止了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貝洛內的，某種意義上，我們也算是同病相憐了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別把我和你相提並論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看得出來，你也是那種看起來很聰明，實際上忠心得要命的蠢貨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別給自己臉上貼金了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是在為自己辯解，我知道自己在做什麼，我不後悔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你呢，如果真的如你所說，你的首領是這一切的始作俑者，而你的兄弟，或許也要站在你的對立面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的下得了手嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的會得到你想要的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢，你得到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，我問心有愧，卻別無他法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmencommand"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法庭護衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閣下，我發現這座指揮塔的技術人員都躲在一間屋子裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "法庭護衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_699_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們想要和你聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......法官閣下？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別緊張，我不會傷害你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我既不代表某一個家族，也不代表西西里夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那你代表什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的我不代表任何東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你不傷害我們，我可以幫你們一些忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我想問你一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是誰讓你們啟動了次級核心區的分離程式，是貝洛內家族的人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他說自己是貝洛內家族的領袖，貝納爾多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "貝納爾多......真的是你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為了所謂的權力，你真的要做到這個地步——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷靜的技術人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_697_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他還問我，有沒有想像過，一個沒有家族的敘拉古。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g1_srcstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面就是能操控那道大門的中樞，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "羅塞蒂家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人生何處不相逢啊，切利尼娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實，我們之間，也只有你死我活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......拉維妮婭，那個法官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們按照您的指示，沒有急著突破，而是繞了一些路，抓到了一個官員。這是從他的口中審出來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她已經帶著自己的手下佔領了指揮塔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誠然，沒有家族會想到，一個小法官居然在一些官員的幫助下，能夠做到這樣的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，就算她用這樣的小把戲拖住了那些家族，她又能做到什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "首領，大事不好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉普蘭德，拉普蘭德剛才忽然回到家族，毫無徵兆地開始攻擊家族裡的人，正在向您這裡靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "攔住她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩盧佐家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g11_mansionhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉普蘭德，你的殺人技術，長進了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放在以往，你走到這裡，還要再花一些時間，並且多受一點傷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你倒是老樣子，眼看著自己的手下被殺，卻還能無動於衷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能力不足的手下，有什麼值得惋惜的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能力不足的孩子呢？哦，瞧我，都忘了，對您來說，孩子和手下，沒有分別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道，乖女兒，我最討厭的，是能力不足卻聽話的蠢貨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我等了你很久，從你回到這個家裡就在等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等著你向我露出獠牙的那一刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，這一刻終於來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我，我的女兒，這麼多年以來，究竟是什麼，讓你一而再，再而三地惹怒我，忤逆我，反抗我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說出來，這樣我才可以管教你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聽到阿爾貝托的話，拉普蘭德笑了一下。\n但是，她卻垂下了手中的武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在想，我是不是應該策劃一場針對你的刺殺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對你來說，弑父難道是一件值得為之猶豫的事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我猶豫的不是行為，而是意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意義？你居然也會探究所謂的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我對意義的重視，如同你對利益的重視。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親，你知道我為什麼那麼關注德克薩斯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你從來沒有對我解釋過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我自出生以來，就以這個家族一員的身份成長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以最標準的敘拉古人式教育來訓練我，而我也回應了你的期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在做一個敘拉古人這件事上，沒有人做得比我更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以為你從不承認自己的身份，乖女兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有哪一刻真的逃離了你的掌控嗎，父親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是你的掌控，是敘拉古，是家族，是血緣，是規則的掌控。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我厭惡這一切，但我最終發現，我無法逃離它們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們在無形之中支配著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論我怎樣去反抗，到最後，我的反抗，也依然在你的掌控之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我找不到出路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有你會認為，敘拉古是一座無法逃離的泥潭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而其他人，包括你，我的父親，你們都是泥水，渾濁而不自知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，在那個年紀，我是想不通這些的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當時的我以為自己足夠瘋狂，足夠叛逆，但現在看來，那些都只不過是自欺欺人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在當時的你看來，再過幾年，我一定就會接受現狀了，對吧，父親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毫無疑問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從你身上感到了叛逆，我卻無法理解你的叛逆從何而來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為你是如此地相信，你的生活、你的行為是正確的，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你從未懷疑過，最終我會變成你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而就在這時，她出現了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一開始，是因為遠在哥倫比亞，有一個做得比我更好的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切利尼娜·德克薩斯，薩爾瓦多雷的孫女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冷酷，強大，重情重義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "踏上敘拉古的土地後，她迅速成了家族之間最為出名的敘拉古人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使她只是一個哥倫比亞人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你與她不分伯仲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但這不是重點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "重點在於，她明明是一個敘拉古人，她明明完全沉醉於這座泥潭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，在最後，她選擇了背棄自己的血緣，放任自己的家族被清算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "應當被譴責的始終是朱塞佩，切利尼娜大義滅親，何罪之有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "背叛在狼群之中並不少見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但她選擇了背棄，她選擇了逃離。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你能想像嗎，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一天，當我發現，她居然想要離開敘拉古，拋棄這一切時，我是多麼地——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "興奮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你難道認為這也是一種反抗，你認為她成功了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她沒有成功，從一開始，我就知道，這片土地不會放過她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，你為何又因她站在我的面前？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，父親，不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會站在這裡，並不是我從她的成功或者失敗中學到了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而是她告訴我，原來還有這種選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道她最終會回到這片土地，我期待的，是她回來之後，會做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而她什麼都沒有做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你不會明白的，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她做出了選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g1_srcstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "切利尼娜，你以為你在做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不必知道，你也不會理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你曾經逃離了哥倫比亞，逃離了敘拉古，將這一切棄之不顧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在，你又厚顏無恥地重新站在這片土地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不覺得可笑嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這片土地還沒有那麼無可救藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我不逃了，就這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不逃了，所以你就回來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些曾經被你丟下的人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去對他們說啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在遷怒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不得不對喬萬娜下手，於是，你將原因歸咎於我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒有那麼無恥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，你也要為此付出代價。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......切利尼娜，你將不得好死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_1028_texas2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別擔心，死亡是我最好的歸宿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瓦拉赫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_695_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可......惡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g7_reception"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是，現在，輪到我了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾經苦思冥想，為此夜不能寐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，當我真的像這樣站在你的面前時，我忽然意識到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，這並不是一件多麼困難的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來，我要做的不是反抗你，不是殺死你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要做的只是向你，向您，向我的父親，向這個家族，向這座泥潭道別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是，我來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想成為整個敘拉古的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你錯了，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是敘拉古成了我的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永別了，父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉普蘭德向著自己的父親深深地行了一個告別禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿爾貝托隱隱約約感覺到，這是自己除掉這個怪物的最後機會。\n是的，怪物。\n由他親手養大的怪物。\n她絕非無人能敵，卻彷彿無法被任何事物擊敗。\n如果現在出手，他有十成的把握，將自己的女兒當場擊殺。\n她絕非無所畏懼，但她主動拋棄了自己能夠失去的一切。\n他理應出手，斷絕後患。\n但是......\n“父親”。\n這畢竟是他親手養大的怪物。\n正如，若是單純的解脫，她又何須來和自己見面？\n離群的狼終究會記得自己屬於哪個族群，但今天之後，他的女兒，將不屬於任何族群。\n阿爾貝托深深歎了口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾貝托",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_686_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次見面，我會殺了你的，我的女兒，我的驕傲，我的叛徒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉普蘭德笑了笑，沒有回答。\n她不再是離群的狼。\n敘拉古再無她的容身之所。\n而她也不再需要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉普蘭德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_683_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的，只有你了，德克薩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "33_g6_newtown_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓切利尼娜一個人去，真的沒問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "放心吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "既然她要求一個人去，那就一定有她的理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不好奇嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你知道嗎，作為一個好搭檔的必要條件，就是不去問對方不想說的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們的關係可真好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "當然！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "有一個人正在往你那邊去，他的速度很快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一個人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "對，就一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "avg_103_angel_1",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "黑髮，穿得像一個很張揚的黑幫少爺，而且拿著兩把銃形法杖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......萊昂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉維妮婭......果然是你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......萊昂圖索，為什麼你會在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在找你。但是，你把和家族有關的聯絡方式全都遮罩了，我聯絡不上你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在尋找途中，從其他家族的人口中得知，有人封鎖了次級核心區的各種通道，這不像是家族會做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才會來這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是了，你跟在卡拉奇身邊那麼久，你理應知道這裡是最適合的突破口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，我已經沒有什麼可跟你說的了，萊昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，拉維妮婭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊昂？！還有拉維妮婭，還有法庭的人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來如此，在背後操控次級核心區的人是你，拉維妮婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊昂，那場會談之後，你究竟去了哪裡？難道你一直和拉維妮婭在一起嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我去找了父親。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼不告訴我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......因為當我面對阿爾貝托時，當我聽到那名洗車工對我的控訴時，我意識到——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "過去的我，錯得離譜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "寬闊的大道上，德米特里與拉維妮婭各站一邊。\n萊昂圖索深吸了一口氣，最終，走向了拉維妮婭那一邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是你的答案？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從現在起，我不再是貝洛內家族的領袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你知道你在做什麼，對吧，萊昂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論首領有什麼崇高的理想，他都拋下了這個家族！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你呢，無論你又有怎樣遠大的目標，你也要拋下這個家族嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是一個家族啊，萊昂圖索！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看著我的眼睛，回答我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們共同長大，共同經歷了那麼多的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對你來說，那些都不值一提嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親將整個家族當做火星，希望點燃敘拉古新時代的導火索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父親確實錯了，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊昂圖索緩緩抬起雙眼，直視著德米特里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最終，我會站在所有家族的對立面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然它必將發生，那麼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就讓我們長痛不如短痛吧，德米特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_690_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而，就在千鈞一髮之際，一股寒意，忽然籠罩了在場的所有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerId": "avg_427_vigil_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什......麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉維妮婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_4065_judge_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......腦海裡......響起了聲音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑色的霧氣在場上凝結。\n隨著霧氣的凝聚，無形的威壓一點一點地被加在了在場之人的頭上，肩上，心中。\n他們從這股威壓中感到了一絲親近，彷彿那是與他們血脈相連的存在......不，那就是與他們血脈相連的存在。\n但下一刻，他們只感到無邊的恐懼，因為這股威壓中，蘊含著無邊的怒火。\n理性在此時被壓制，彷彿有一個聲音在告訴他們——\n跪下。\n臣服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好冷......"
